  "description": "<p>From documentation review</p>\n\n<p><em>Updated title from singluar to plural, for accuracy. Also made a few minor grammatical changes for clarity. Issue that needs review:We may want to reach out to the contributing institutions to ask whether they can review whether the supplied examples are still accurate and current (Northwestern, for example, is &#8211; as far as I know &#8211; no longer using Fedora with their streaming media system).</em></p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1c4y8QH_hmcnL7vdsk4d9Qi9UzLFjyIUtyYFvdPDaN-M/edit?pli=1&amp;gid=0#gid=0\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1c4y8QH_hmcnL7vdsk4d9Qi9UzLFjyIUtyYFvdPDaN-M/edit?pli=1&amp;gid=0#gid=0</a>  line 90</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Example+Content+Models\" title=\"smart-link\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FEDORA6x/Example+Content+Models</a> </p>",
